## X-ZacUI-Part: QoL

# Part of ZacUI. These files were lifted out of the main addon so this
# piece can be switched off in the AddOns list on its own. They share
# ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by Core_Boot) and its saved
# variables; every setting still lives in ZacUIDB and in profiles.
# Load order within this file is the same as it was inside ZacUI.

QoL_Data.lua
QoL_Core.lua
QoL_Automation.lua
QoL_RaidPerf.lua
QoL_BossFX.lua
QoL_BuffRemover.lua
QoL_MacroCleanup.lua
QoL_SmartMount.lua
QoL_AutoRoll.lua
QoL_RaidTimers.lua
QoL_Snowball.lua
QoL_GCDTracker.lua
QoL_DialogKeys.lua
# Feature cluster 1 (2026-11-07), each a file of its own with its card on the
# Quality of life page: combat logging on its own in raids, the low
# durability warning, the unspent talent points reminder.
QoL_CombatLog.lua
QoL_Durability.lua
QoL_TalentReminder.lua
# Feature cluster 3 (2026-11-07): the small automations QoL_Automation
# lacked (DELETE typed, containers opened, cinematics skipped, a res
# accepted, release in battlegrounds), each its own switch, all off.
QoL_Autos.lua
# Feature cluster 3: the loot feed (fading rows for loot, money, rep, skill-ups).
QoL_LootFeed.lua
# Overnight gap build (2026-11-08, ELLESMERE_GAPS_1108.md), each its own file,
# all off by default: quest helpers, quest tracker visibility, alerts, gathering
# skill on node tooltips, the junk items window, character stats, cursor rings,
# reminders (pet / tracking / ready-check mana), data blocks, target distance.
QoL_Quests.lua
QoL_TrackerVis.lua
QoL_Alerts.lua
QoL_GatherSkill.lua
QoL_JunkItems.lua
QoL_Stats.lua
QoL_Cursor.lua
QoL_Reminders.lua
QoL_DataBlocks.lua
QoL_Distance.lua
Config_PagesQoL.lua
